        <div class="tab-content">
            <div class="tab-pane" id="typography">

                <h5 class="ui-title">Font families</h5>
                <table class="ui-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Family</th><th>Usage</th><th>Weights</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th>Canela<small>--heading-font-family</small></th><td>Headings, accent text</td><td><div class="ui-specimen" style="font-family: Canela;"><span style="font-weight:100">Thin 100</span> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:300">Light 300</span> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:400">Regular 400</span> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:500">Medium 500</span></div></td></tr>
                        <tr><th>TT Commons<small>--base-font-family</small></th><td>Body text, buttons, UI</td><td><div class="ui-specimen" style="font-family: 'TT Commons';"><span>Regular 400</span> &nbsp; <em>Italic 400</em> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:500">Medium 500</span> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:600">DemiBold 600</span> &nbsp; <span style="font-weight:700">Bold 700</span></div></td></tr>
                        <tr><th>icomoon</th><td>Icon font</td><td><div class="ui-specimen"><i class="e-icon e-icon-cart"></i> <i class="e-icon e-icon-user"></i> <i class="e-icon e-icon-gift"></i> <i class="e-icon e-icon-checkmark"></i> &mdash; see the Icons tab</div></td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p class="ui-el__note">Defined in <code>base/_fonts.scss</code>. <code>strong</code> is 600. Base text: 18px / 1.25, weight 400, TT Commons.</p>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Headings</h5>
                <table class="ui-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Tag / class</th><th>Specimen</th><th>Desktop</th><th>&le; 991px</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th><code>h1</code> / <code>.h1</code><small>--font-h1(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h1>The quick brown fox jumps</h1></div></td><td>46px</td><td>32px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>h2</code> / <code>.h2</code><small>--font-h2(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h2>The quick brown fox jumps</h2></div></td><td>38px</td><td>28px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>h3</code> / <code>.h3</code><small>--font-h3(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h3>The quick brown fox jumps</h3></div></td><td>32px</td><td>24px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>h4</code> / <code>.h4</code><small>--font-h4(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h4>The quick brown fox jumps</h4></div></td><td>28px</td><td>18px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>h5</code> / <code>.h5</code><small>--font-h5(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h5>The quick brown fox jumps</h5></div></td><td>24px</td><td>20px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>h6</code> / <code>.h6</code><small>--font-h6(-mob)</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><h6>The quick brown fox jumps</h6></div></td><td>20px</td><td>20px</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p class="ui-el__note">Canela, weight 300, color <code>--heading-color</code> (#212428), margin-bottom 0.5rem. Classes <code>.h1</code>&ndash;<code>.h6</code> give the same look to any tag. h6 has no mobile override. Line-height vars <code>--font-hN-lh</code> are declared with <code>list-style</code> instead of <code>line-height</code> in <code>base/_typography.scss</code>, so they currently do nothing.</p>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Body text</h5>
                <table class="ui-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Specimen</th><th>Size</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th><code>p</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolorum quos accusantium earum asperiores suscipit facilis quas aliquam.</p></div></td><td>18px / 1.25, 400</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>strong</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><strong>Bold text inside a paragraph</strong></div></td><td>600</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>em</code> / <code>i</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><em>Italic text</em></div></td><td>TT Commons Italic</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>a</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><a href="#">Link text</a> (underline on hover)</div></td><td>inherits color</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>small</code> / <code>--small-font-size</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen" style="font-size:14px;">Small text</div></td><td>14px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.e-declaimer</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="e-declaimer">Disclaimer text, grey</span></div></td><td>16px / 1.25 (14px on mobile), #8b8c8e</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Font weights</h5>
                <table class="ui-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Weight</th><th>Specimen</th><th>Used for</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th><code>100</code><small>Thin</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:100">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:100">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>Canela only</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>300</code><small>Light</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:300">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:300">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>Canela headings</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>400 / normal</code><small>Regular</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:400">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:400">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>Body text</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>500</code><small>Medium</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:500">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:500">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>Pills, tags, labels</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>600</code><small>DemiBold</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:600">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:600">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>Buttons, strong</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>700 / bold</code><small>Bold</small></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span style="font-family:'TT Commons';font-weight:700">TT Commons &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-family:Canela;font-weight:700">Canela &mdash; The quick brown fox jumps</span></div></td><td>TT Commons</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Font-size utilities</h5>
                <table class="ui-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Specimen</th><th>Size</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-9</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-9">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>9px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-10</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-10">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>10px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-11</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-11">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>11px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-12</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-12">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>12px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-13</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-13">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>13px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-14</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-14">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>14px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-16</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-16">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>16px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-18</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-18">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>18px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-20</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-20">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>20px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-22</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-22">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>22px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-24</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-24">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>24px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-26</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-26">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>26px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-28</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-28">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>28px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-30</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-30">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>30px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-32</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-32">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>32px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-34</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-34">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>34px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-38</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-38">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>38px</td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>.fs-46</code></th><td><div class="ui-specimen"><span class="fs-46">Skin that looks and feels its best</span></div></td><td>46px</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p class="ui-el__note">Every size also exists per breakpoint: <code>.fs-sm-*</code> (&ge;576px), <code>.fs-md-*</code> (&ge;768px), <code>.fs-lg-*</code> (&ge;992px), <code>.fs-xl-*</code> (&ge;1200px), <code>.fs-xxl-*</code> (&ge;1400px), e.g. <code>fs-16 fs-lg-20</code>. All use <code>!important</code>.</p>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Font sizes used in SCSS</h5>
                <ul class="ui-chips"><li><strong>6px</strong><span>&times;5</span></li><li><strong>8px</strong><span>&times;16</span></li><li><strong>9px</strong><span>&times;6</span></li><li><strong>10px</strong><span>&times;22</span></li><li><strong>11px</strong><span>&times;7</span></li><li><strong>12px</strong><span>&times;89</span></li><li><strong>13px</strong><span>&times;12</span></li><li><strong>14px</strong><span>&times;172</span></li><li><strong>15px</strong><span>&times;4</span></li><li><strong>16px</strong><span>&times;236</span></li><li><strong>18px</strong><span>&times;77</span></li><li><strong>20px</strong><span>&times;92</span></li><li><strong>22px</strong><span>&times;18</span></li><li><strong>24px</strong><span>&times;24</span></li><li><strong>25px</strong><span>&times;5</span></li><li><strong>26px</strong><span>&times;11</span></li><li><strong>28px</strong><span>&times;19</span></li><li><strong>30px</strong><span>&times;16</span></li><li><strong>32px</strong><span>&times;13</span></li><li><strong>33px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>34px</strong><span>&times;15</span></li><li><strong>35px</strong><span>&times;8</span></li><li><strong>36px</strong><span>&times;7</span></li><li><strong>38px</strong><span>&times;10</span></li><li><strong>40px</strong><span>&times;14</span></li><li><strong>42px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>43px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>45px</strong><span>&times;2</span></li><li><strong>46px</strong><span>&times;17</span></li><li><strong>50px</strong><span>&times;3</span></li><li><strong>52px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>55px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>56px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>60px</strong><span>&times;3</span></li><li><strong>68px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>70px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>80px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>90px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li><li><strong>99px</strong><span>&times;1</span></li></ul>
                <p class="ui-el__note">How many times each <code>font-size: Npx</code> appears in SCSS (components, sections, pages). The most common are 16px, 14px, 20px, 12px, 18px. Non-standard sizes (6, 8, 15, 25, 33, 35, 43, 45, 52&ndash;99px) are one-offs and are not part of the <code>.fs-*</code> scale.</p>

                <h5 class="ui-title">Text colors</h5>
