                        <tr><th><code>d-md-none</code></th><td>Hidden from 992px</td><td><div class="ui-demo"><span class="ui-demo__item d-md-none">Visible</span></div></td></tr>
                        <tr><th><code>d-lg-none</code></th><td>Hidden from 1200px</td><td><div class="ui-demo"><span class="ui-demo__item d-lg-none">Visible</span></div></td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p class="ui-el__note">Pattern: <code>.d-{breakpoint}-{value}</code> with breakpoints <code>sm</code> (&ge;768px), <code>md</code> (&ge;992px), <code>lg</code> (&ge;1200px) and values <code>none, inline, inline-block, block, flex, grid, inline-flex</code> (defined in <code>base/_display.scss</code>). Classes are mobile-first: <code>d-none d-md-block</code> hides below 992px and shows from 992px. Most used in markup: <code>d-none</code>, <code>d-lg-none</code> / <code>d-lg-block</code>, <code>d-sm-none</code> / <code>d-sm-block</code>.</p>

